        "`√U`, the square root of a unit: an amplitude spectral density in V/√Hz is `Per<Volt, Sqrt<Hertz>>`. Its",
        "dimension has the root flag ([Dim::sqrt](crate::Dim::sqrt)): the exponents of V²/Hz, so the algebra stays integer.",
